            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P1 · Batch Output Not Produced In Window\n**WHAT:** Batch Output Not Produced In Window: freshness signal detected by threshold analysis.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `batch-platform` (integration / batch_job, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Customers are affected now, or a mission-critical capability is unavailable.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** Daily batches have a contractual delivery time; 26 hours means yesterday's output never arrived. The number is the SLA.\n\n**OWNER:** application-development · support 24x7 · this pages the on-call rotation\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `Batch Output Not Produced In Window` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `remediate-rerun-job` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `batch-platform.prod.batch-platform` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-batch-completion` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Batch Output Not Produced In Window — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P1.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Batch Output Not Produced In Window — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Batch Output Not Produced In Window\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-batch-completion`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
