            "id": "314408851",
            "include_tags": true,
            "locked": false,
            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P3 · Interface Error Rate Rising\n**WHAT:** Rate-of-change, not absolute: a link with a stable low error count has a known cabling quirk; a link whose error rate doubles is failing now.\n\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `network-platform` (network / network_device, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Nothing is broken yet. A boundary will be crossed if nobody acts within the lead time this monitor provides.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** The signal changed faster than the configured percentage relative to its own recent history. Speed of degradation, not absolute level.\n**OWNER:** infrastructure-engineering · support 24x7 · this does not page\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `Interface Error Rate Rising` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-network` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `network-core.prod.network-platform` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-network-availability` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Interface Error Rate Rising — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P3.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Interface Error Rate Rising — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Interface Error Rate Rising\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-network-availability`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
            "monitor_threshold_windows": [],
            "monitor_thresholds": [
              {
                "critical": "100",
                "critical_recovery": "",
                "ok": "",
                "unknown": "",
                "warning": "50",
                "warning_recovery": ""
              }
            ],
            "name": "[P3][prod][network] Interface Error Rate Rising (critical)",
            "new_group_delay": 300,
            "new_host_delay": 300,
            "no_data_timeframe": 0,
            "notification_preset_name": "",
            "notify_audit": false,
            "notify_by": [
              "device"
            ],
            "notify_no_data": false,
            "on_missing_data": "",
            "priority": "3",
            "query": "pct_change(avg(last_15m),last_4h):sum:snmp.ifInErrors{env:prod,alert_band:critical} by {device,interface}.as_rate() \u003e 100",
