            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P3 · Long-Running Query Blocking Workload\n**WHAT:** Long-Running Query Blocking Workload: latency signal detected by threshold analysis.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `database-platform` (database / db_instance, tier2)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** The service still functions but measurably worse; a subset of traffic or users is failing.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** 15 minutes exceeds every documented OLTP statement timeout in the estate; beyond it the query is holding locks, not working.\n\n**OWNER:** data-engineering · support business-hours · this does not page\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `Long-Running Query Blocking Workload` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-database` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `databases.prod.database-platform` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-database-latency` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Long-Running Query Blocking Workload — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P3.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Long-Running Query Blocking Workload — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Long-Running Query Blocking Workload\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-database-latency`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
